cocu0204	Peter M: Those grinder-- No, the--
cocu0205	Tim: Oh, the grinders.
cocu0206	Peter M: The grinders. The curling irons, to a lesser degree.
cocu0207	Tim: Those are based on my sister's curling iron. No, you don't call them curling irons. Curlers! Based on my sister's curlers.
cocu0208	Peter M: Curlers, right.
cocu0209	Tim: And my terrible fear of curlers.
cocu0210	Peter M: They're fearsome things.
