cosu0201	Tim: So he's been-- This is like a play on moth navigation. Like they say that moths fly into lights 'cause they're used to using the moon for navigation, and they're not used to electric lights. And so he's, um, used to using the moon for navigation but he's been distracted by this thing called The Pearl. And it's made him march in circles all these years.
