coew0102	Paul: Yeah. I kind of remember that, towards the end, 'cause it was just like a skeleton crew. The budget had gotten so big that I just remember Pete [Tsaykel] and a few other people working on it for a couple of months or something, while all of us had to move on to other projects.
colu0101	Peter M: So once in a while, if there was a solo part that we could, um, get to be recorded by a real person, we would do that. But um, I don't know if you remember, we were kind of under a lot of schedule pressure with that.
