colu0103	Peter M: And people were like--
colu0104	Tim: One late night or two. There was a late night or two.
colu0105	Peter M: And then there was like, "You're spending thirteen thousand dollars on live musicians!? Are you crazy?" So we were lucky we could do what we could do at all, but...
colu0106	Tim: And look, where are those guys today? I don't even remember their names, and here we are talking about "Grim."
colu0107	Peter M: Exactly.
