plgvl03a	You gotta watch your step around here, stranger.
plgvl03b	Rubacava ain't the quaint little port town she used to be.
plgvl04a	Wwwweeell-hell-hell.  Looks like there's a new vessel in town.
plgvl04b	Pardon me whilst I go check her out!
rm3co15a	Get in there and stay put until the boys downtown tell us what they want done with ya.
rm3co15b	Someone's gonna take the fall for this, Calavera, and it ain't gonna be me!
sito148a	.’…˜†„ Œ‹ š€ ƒ‰˜…--‰ƒ Œ…ƒ‚
