rm_ma01	Buenos Días.
in_ma10	Everybody here is just as dead as you.
in_ma11	That's why we call it the "Land of the Dead."
reume02x	Manny!  What are you doing here?
reuma03x	I wanted to see how your trip was going, Angel.  I AM your travel agent, you know.
ll_ma14	I coulda walked faster than this!  Rrr, híjole, I'm gonna miss the poisoning!
bp_bo02	Cut the yap.  I want something cheap where I can get some rest, and that's it.
bp_co20	If you haven't bagged a premium before the next sales report comes in, you're out!
rm_me06	Guess they couldn't save me, eh?
rm_ma07	No, but there's still a chance you could save me.
lq_sv11	I was once a reaper like yourself, Manuel.  But I uncovered a web of corruption in our beloved Department of Death.
lsasv09x	I have reason to believe that the Bureau of Acquisitions is cheating the very souls it was chartered to serve.  I think someone is robbing these poor, naïve souls of their rightful destinies, leaving them no option but to march on a treacherous trail of tears, unprotected and alone.  Like babies, Manuel. Like babies.
lsama10x	What's your evidence?
lsasv11x	That's where you come in, Manuel.  Or, should I call you "Agent Calavera?"
lsama12x	"Manny" suits me fine.  I'm not looking to join any military organization, Sal.  I just want my job back so I can work off my time and get out of this dump.
lsasv13x	Well, you won't even be able to get out of this city with out my help.  Which means, of course, you won't be able to find that woman, and you'll never get your job back.  When you're ready to join the cause, Manuel, come talk to me.  We might be of some use to each other.
cd_co08	Hector!  No!
idcmb02	It looks like I've got one of your boys down here in the morgue.
lldlo09x	Tell me, Manny.  Would I have had a chance?
reudo1x	Hahahahaha!
reudo2x	I've got to get back to the city where the action is.
pl_vl03	You gotta watch your step around here, stranger. Rubacava ain't the quaint little port town she used to be.
st_sv05	Manuel?  Are you...
st_sv06	...in love with her?
st_ma07	Love?  Love is for the living, Sal.  I'm only after her for one reason...
st_ma08	...She's my ticket out of here.
brubo03	Ah, phooey!
brubo04x	I'm getting out of here.  This world's for suckers.
